<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- ============================ BEGINNER GUIDE ============================
  This is the SINGLE-SUBJECT page: it lists one subject's Learning Outcomes (L.Os).
  The URL decides which subject to show, e.g.  subject.html?s=math  (and ?s=religion&b=islam
  for a subject that has branches). The <script> at the bottom reads ?s= / ?b= and reveals the
  matching .subject-group below (all groups live in this one file; the others stay hidden).

  How the L.O cards were made:
    • Every card was generated from the matching PDF in the "los/" folder, in the same order.
    • Subjects that have a PDF also get a gold "Official ... L.O Syllabus (PDF)" card that links
      straight to that file in los/.
    • Subjects WITHOUT a PDF (Arabic, Religion, Capstone, Opportunities, Arduino) are left empty,
      so the page shows the "No learning outcomes" message.

  To edit an L.O: find its <!-- L.O CODE ... --> comment and change the card under it.
  To add an L.O: copy any <a class="lo-card"> block, change the code/title/description, and set
  its href to lesson.html?id=CODE (then add a matching block in lesson.html — see that file).
======================================================================== -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Subject Learning Outcomes — QSTEMora Club</title>
  
  <!-- Google Fonts: Poppins & Outfit -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brandDark: '#0A1926',
            brandDarker: '#07131F',
            brandCard: '#0E2238',
            brandGold: '#F5BC6B',
            brandTeal: '#48A9A6',
            brandCyan: '#38B2AC',
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Poppins', 'Outfit', 'sans-serif'],
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <!-- Favicon -->
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="assets/images/logo.jpg">

  <!-- Custom Stylesheet -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-[#071A26] text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col selection:bg-[#F5BC6B] selection:text-[#071A26]">

  <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->
